  "commentary": [
    {
      "t": 0,
      "text": "Barcelona still searching for a way back into this tie…"
    },
    {
      "t": 1.5,
      "text": "Iniesta, patient, looking for the opening."
    },
    {
      "t": 3.8,
      "text": "Ronaldinho has it on the edge of the area, Carvalho right in front."
    },
    {
      "t": 5.2,
      "text": "Ronaldinho's hardly moving… just swaying, teasing the defender…"
    },
    {
      "t": 7.2,
      "text": "Oh, Ronaldinho's poked it—"
    },
    {
      "t": 8.1,
      "text": "IT'S IN! Out of absolutely nothing! Čech didn't even move!"
    },
    {
      "t": 9.2,
      "text": "No run-up, no backswing. Pure invention from Ronaldinho!"
    },
    {
      "t": 10.2,
      "text": "And that makes it four-all on aggregate."
    }
